CreateSaleTest
├── when the caller lacks PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
└── when the caller has PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE and contract is not paused
    ├── when the token address is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidToken
    ├── when the price per token is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidPrice
    ├── when a sale already exists for this token
    │   └── it should revert with SaleAlreadyExists
    ├── when the property is not registered in PropertyRegistry
    │   └── it should revert with PropertyNotRegistered
    ├── when the property is not available (cancelled or sold)
    │   └── it should revert with PropertyNotAvailable
    ├── when the caller is not the property issuer
    │   └── it should revert with NotSaleIssuer
    └── when all parameters are valid
        ├── it should create the sale with correct data
        ├── it should mark saleExists as true
        ├── it should add the token to allSales array
        ├── it should set isActive to true
        └── it should emit SaleCreated event

